            "content": "<p>Elixir delivers 1mg per shot (50mg per pod) — great for beginners or a lighter experience. Elixir+ is 2.5mg per shot (100mg per pod) — for those who want a stronger or longer-lasting effect. When in doubt, start with Elixir.</p>",
